tle":"35MG","offer_id":41652564754487,"sku":"Nasty Liq Fruit Fusion 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564787255,"sku":"Nasty Liq Fruit Fusion 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Fruit-Fusion-min.jpg?v=1746639923"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-raspberry-watermelon-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eQuench your thirst with the succulent sweetness of ripe raspberries and juicy watermelon, creating a refreshing fusion of fruity flavors that's perfect for all-day vaping.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564820023,"sku":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564852791,"sku":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Raspberry-Watermelon-min.jpg?v=1746639925"},{"product_id":"nasty-cushman-mango-nic-salt-juice","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThree layer of goodness from finest mango around the world. Cushman Mango by Nasty Salt is an exotic blend of juiced mangoes, reduced to a tasty vapable nectar that is mixed into a healthy serving of premium nicotine salts to create an \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-e-liquid\" title=\"nasty e liquid\"\u003enasty e liquid\u003c\/a\u003e that will delight the senses.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHigher dosage of nicotine making it perfect for pod open system device and for mouth to lung vaping. Nasty Salt should never be used in sub-ohm tanks or any dripper styled vape system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652567113783,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652567146551,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-kenya-cushman-mango-e-liquid.png?v=1746640073"},{"product_id":"nasty-mango-grape-nicotine-salt-cush-man-salt","title":"Nasty Mango Grape Nicotine Salt - Cush Man Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape is all mango flavors. In the Cushman series, Nasty takes their beloved mango flavor and twists it with other flavors to satisfy the vaping tongues of people that love mango!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe flavor of mango in this \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-e-liquid\" title=\"nicotine e juice\"\u003enicotine e juice\u003c\/a\u003e recipe tastes of familiar yellow mango. It is a ripe, sweet and luscious yellow mango flavor that is very easily identifiable. It has a strong mango aroma and tastes thick with a heavy mouthfeel. As for the grape flavor in this e juice, it is more of a candy grape flavor. We would say that the ratio of mango and grape is very balanced since you can easily feel the taste of both in every puff you take. This e juice is sweet with strong flavors that lingers in your mouth.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you love juicy, ripe mangoes (we do!) and can't get enough of grape, Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape e juice is the one for you. Tried and tested, it is a favourite of ours here at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"[YOUR BRAND]\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e! We would say that this is e juice has a high level of sweetness with a low cooling chill effect.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePerfect for vapers that love the flavors of mango and looking for something sweet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652567179319,"sku":"Nasty Mango Grape - Cush Man Salt 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652567212087,"sku":"Nasty Mango Grape - Cush Man Salt 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/mango-grape_nasty_nic_salts.jpg?v=1746640077"},{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-rich-black-grape","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Rich Black Grape","description":"\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe chaos of divine black grapes with an understated dash of mint.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670481543223,"sku":"69d25e5422543","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670481575991,"sku":"69d25e54bad53","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-salt-rich-black-grape-vape-juice.jpg?v=1747700458"},{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-triple-mint","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Triple Mint","description":"\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIf you like fresh and cool \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ee-liquid\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Triple Mint by Riot Salts is your ticket to frosty satisfaction. A menthol core is layered with vivid peppermint and smooth spearmint extracts, creating a triple-concentrated blast of ice whenever you take a draw.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670481608759,"sku":"69d25e582f132","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670481641527,"sku":"69d25e58c534d","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-salt-triple-mint-vape-juice.jpg?v=1747700461"},{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-watermelon-ice","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Watermelon Ice","description":"\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRiot Squad are taking sweet slices of juicy watermelon and freezing them over with a chilled blast of menthol for the ultimate fruity vape refreshment!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670481674295,"sku":"69d25e58664a5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670481707063,"sku":"69d25e59037d3","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"